{"path":"/zh/patterns/m1-hierarchical-retention/cases/liangbo/","title":"M1 · 分层保留 · 东方屹腾执行型 Agent","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-6cf6a265e614fc9a-1","revision":"6cf6a265e614fc9acb80701359f3bcfc20b001bfbafa133d1a3e97c7f175fe7c","tag":"p","quote":"模式矩阵/M1 分层保留/蓝皮书"},{"block_id":"adps-66d588002827c27f-1","revision":"66d588002827c27fb6d5d0b2bb265ce3e4b31c0f1c98a7f750fc3148dc5358a5","tag":"table","quote":"字段 值 主模式 M1 分层保留 Hierarchical Retention（记忆 × 层级） 结合模式 M4 失败日记 · M3 进度追踪 案例 上海东方屹腾科技 · HR/薪酬 SaaS · 服务 2 万+ 企业 · 执行型 Agent 对应白皮书 /zh/patterns/m1-hierarchical-retention/ 源 梁博 AICon 逐字稿第七章 · PPT 第 26–27 页 工程结论 L1 保存当前输入，L2 保存任务事实，L3 保存跨任务经验；L3 只在关键推理边界召回，并通过 ID 回指 L2 原始事实。"},{"block_id":"adps-2b37e8a9d6d34541-1","revision":"2b37e8a9d6d345416b8c7ff6ce60607db7b1d23d20640ee08c477d36fec791f8","tag":"p","quote":"薪资组配置、算薪、代发和员工入职等任务会跨十余次模型调用。当前步骤、当前任务和历史任务需要不同粒度的信息。若全部放入同一上下文，成本和噪声会随任务长度增加；若只保留摘要，审计时又无法核对原始事实。"},{"block_id":"adps-f192cb851f3e7e35-1","revision":"f192cb851f3e7e355dd710b352bc2ee842e183daaae4c8c95dd4515ce39c690d","tag":"table","quote":"层级 内容 存储 访问方式 L1 当前推理所需的最小上下文 内存 直接注入 L2 当前任务的里程碑和原始事实 关系型数据库 按任务或 ID 精确读取 L3 从成功和失败中提炼的经验 向量数据库 按语义相似度召回"},{"block_id":"adps-1462528095465578-1","revision":"14625280954655781854fece478d1ee51def6b9ee062212191e24184ccc3fe43","tag":"p","quote":"L3 条目保存对应的 L2 事实 ID。检索阶段先返回经验摘要；需要确认形成经验的具体条件时，再按 ID 读取 L2。这种按引用加载的方式与操作系统内存分页的原则相近。"},{"block_id":"adps-493e59c0df82aa70-1","revision":"493e59c0df82aa709b11b2f987ddceb30808190ee4d277022a44d119519e8f25","tag":"p","quote":"L2 在关键里程碑完成时追加事实。L3 在任务成功或失败后由反思流程生成，内容包括："},{"block_id":"adps-fc3175cc7b893c70-1","revision":"fc3175cc7b893c703f40c65e094cd8624ba5db6ccad444b81e95139ec22c54f7","tag":"li","quote":"适用的任务类型和前置条件；"},{"block_id":"adps-f953e7ce3acf6982-1","revision":"f953e7ce3acf6982778b17319221d0495cb022b14f6c342299f2582933f90fa1","tag":"li","quote":"采用的 Skill 或处理策略；"},{"block_id":"adps-f290f832b7136196-1","revision":"f290f832b713619643e2a43de4d3eae68adcf46285e725fc552b13eef4b58f56","tag":"li","quote":"来源任务、L2 事实 ID 和生成版本；"},{"block_id":"adps-a65fb25961ccdc27-1","revision":"a65fb25961ccdc27d1715df0b7ddc59168967e5fe5e1f955adeb98436098a002","tag":"li","quote":"可信度、审核状态和失效条件。"},{"block_id":"adps-dce0d956e3174210-1","revision":"dce0d956e3174210f49d8fcc43424da1e7ea5cdaa45345bdf9a54fbee4796508","tag":"p","quote":"L3 写入前应执行去重和可信度校验。一次偶发结果不能直接升级为长期经验；失败原因未确认时，可以先保留为待验证条目。"},{"block_id":"adps-b6d821ab57cbb4f5-1","revision":"b6d821ab57cbb4f598614e51779f1490d2ca81effca2b4d59758b709ca64afa2","tag":"p","quote":"L3 集中在三类入口召回："},{"block_id":"adps-9963e703a3ced0a2-1","revision":"9963e703a3ced0a21e90148195790079e573828bdadf533fec045adf66ff74b5","tag":"p","quote":"链路中间的常规步骤使用当前任务状态，不重复检索 L3。召回结果进入 ReasonContext，并与 Anchor 同时呈现。历史经验只提供候选判断，不能覆盖当前用户目标和实时健康状态。"},{"block_id":"adps-62d60e6585ee76b8-1","revision":"62d60e6585ee76b8f42858a1ce6ed1eea85afe623f6c9a36c19793b25c64478d","tag":"p","quote":"若以往薪资组配置已经验证某个 Skill 有效，新任务可以优先评估该 Skill。若历史任务在某 API 处失败，规划器可以在正式流程前插入健康检查节点。健康检查的当前结果仍是执行依据，历史失败记录不直接阻断任务。"},{"block_id":"adps-6d6d9dca9317b1c8-1","revision":"6d6d9dca9317b1c8b899d9332ad3aa3426dd969bd6717aa7f26f0bd40fb37b06","tag":"li","quote":"每个推理步骤都查询 L3；"},{"block_id":"adps-fc71e5e3d693d761-1","revision":"fc71e5e3d693d7613ceffc0c14757a9bd4728890e1816e44777017dcce6c9f00","tag":"li","quote":"L3 保存整段原始日志，没有可复用判断；"},{"block_id":"adps-7d9156c503db2f97-1","revision":"7d9156c503db2f97fd85d22d91c5cc73c25c993571d91da070e291f3acaef00e","tag":"li","quote":"L3 没有来源引用，无法回到 L2 核对；"},{"block_id":"adps-ab232646cdb63322-1","revision":"ab232646cdb63322215dad704fb44982b23a0b7019267c2f09e1f3ffe72bb7bf","tag":"li","quote":"单次偶发结果未经验证便写入长期经验；"},{"block_id":"adps-9b17bcdd3ef2b847-1","revision":"9b17bcdd3ef2b8475222879a04b12b32c36cf4dd5bb4da4c47b7c948c5b60ef2","tag":"li","quote":"相似经验覆盖当前 Anchor；"},{"block_id":"adps-f701985c777062c6-1","revision":"f701985c777062c6968509b9d3e534eb6ba4aae02d692b3563cfd86c97828dc8","tag":"li","quote":"L1 持续累积历史内容，失去最小上下文属性。"},{"block_id":"adps-56f9a2fd19d9235a-1","revision":"56f9a2fd19d9235ae011ba70ddd0925a45e326628a273021e55159569e3a47c3","tag":"li","quote":"L3 在关键入口以外的额外召回次数；"},{"block_id":"adps-58c9f29359e284aa-1","revision":"58c9f29359e284aa36ec5d9e9d30365d9b68502c9604e05a40b4ab7848ccc6fe","tag":"li","quote":"正向经验命中后的规划收敛时间；"},{"block_id":"adps-d9099ee9ba3c2636-1","revision":"d9099ee9ba3c26365f8a3848ac6a81d71687eb9b967508333714a3fa92656a36","tag":"li","quote":"负向经验触发健康检查后避免的无效前序执行；"},{"block_id":"adps-57051b0f07d37131-1","revision":"57051b0f07d37131edca7a03d858adafd48b4e1f3455668b83fa3b91b0391d22","tag":"li","quote":"L3 命中准确率、过期率和人工驳回率；"},{"block_id":"adps-79dffacff24fed75-1","revision":"79dffacff24fed75936e6d4fd90524e10c31807c138f32a605217d6e1d1cb776","tag":"li","quote":"L3 到 L2 来源引用的完整率；"},{"block_id":"adps-914ac7a622e3036d-1","revision":"914ac7a622e3036d2c8fcbb3263beffdf3c047aff880d3b451bcad93c95026cb","tag":"li","quote":"分层后的 Token、延迟和存储成本。"},{"block_id":"adps-88f8d5ea20f4e99e-1","revision":"88f8d5ea20f4e99ed196185ce7ca5d0109c7d642e9234c2ccae6f1e2153f1534","tag":"p","quote":"M1 白皮书要求按作用域和时间尺度分层，并为每层选择独立后端。东方屹腾用数据库承载 L2 精确事实，用向量索引承载 L3 语义检索，并以 ID 完成按需加载。"},{"block_id":"adps-c0f17e1967e1f328-1","revision":"c0f17e1967e1f32891e66044aeea679ac1d5c7aabd963686bd6afebec5514f2e","tag":"p","quote":"同类任务会重复出现、历史成功或失败能够改变新计划、且前序执行成本较高时，L3 具有实际收益。一次性任务或相似度很低的任务可以先实现 L1 和 L2，不必建设经验向量库。"},{"block_id":"adps-e6cfd6dc6dede8c2-1","revision":"e6cfd6dc6dede8c278f91f874cc24c8cb8a9d2130ba1a061159fd91b17a429c1","tag":"p","quote":"引用建议：ADPS、梁博，《东方屹腾 · 分层保留》，企业 Agent 系统蓝皮书 v0.4，2026-08-02。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-79480e7125ad6903-1","revision":"79480e7125ad690354825fcdaaf560618dbc0f310b5df40f3f9e4ed205348fd8","tag":"p","quote":"证据边界：本页是完整案例的模式切片，记录特定系统约束下的实现选择。案例方提供的实现与效果信息未经过独立审计，不构成通用性能承诺。"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
